# Production build values (committed, no secrets).
# `vite build` runs in `production` mode and loads this file, baking
# VITE_API_URL into the bundle. Without it the app fails appConfig validation
# at import time (fail-fast) and the page stays blank under `vite preview`
# (the CI e2e mode).
# Relative on purpose: production serves the app from the same origin as the API
# (see docs/related-projects.md). If the API ever lives on another origin, put
# the absolute URL here and enable CORS on the backend.
VITE_API_URL=/
